{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "a2c92372-ca02-405c-89c6-a7577377e7a9", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T15:27:54Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-101_invasion_events_haengju-advance", "lang": "ko", "locator": "내용 (일본군 진군)", "pageSha256": "f8a08e1f7b1b69b2c4e0ce8ee43a854f877c738099a5baa410a614fc13db6987", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0062859", "sourceId": "src-encykorea-haengju", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0062859", "text": "7개 부대로 나눠 행주산성으로 진군하였다."}
{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "a2c92372-ca02-405c-89c6-a7577377e7a9", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T15:27:54Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-101_invasion_events_haengju-women", "lang": "ko", "locator": "내용 (제7대 공격 국면)", "pageSha256": "f8a08e1f7b1b69b2c4e0ce8ee43a854f877c738099a5baa410a614fc13db6987", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0062859", "sourceId": "src-encykorea-haengju", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0062859", "text": "이때 부녀자들까지 동원되어 관민이 일치단결해 싸웠다."}
{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "a2c92372-ca02-405c-89c6-a7577377e7a9", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-07T15:27:54Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-101_invasion_events_haengju-cheoyeong", "lang": "ko", "locator": "내용 (제6대 공격 국면)", "pageSha256": "f8a08e1f7b1b69b2c4e0ce8ee43a854f877c738099a5baa410a614fc13db6987", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0062859", "sourceId": "src-encykorea-haengju", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0062859", "text": "처영은 승의군을 이끌고 용감히 맞섰다."}
